{"id":"n18381-3-7","stage":1,"title":"고치다 · 改正","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18381-3-7-1","ko":"삼 번 문제의 답이 이 번이래.","zh":"听说第三题的答案是选项二。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼","meaning":"第三","explanation":"삼：第三","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61980","senseId":"2","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제의","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"답이","meaning":"应答，解答","explanation":"답：应答，解答；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"二","explanation":"이：二","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71125","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번이래.","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"第三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61980","definition":"第三位的。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"号","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"给某人或某物标的号码。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"9d0673c3b91f0428","term":"답","zh":"应答，解答","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3","entryId":"14003","definition":"对疑问或问题所要求的内容进行阐明；或指那种话。","pronunciation":["답"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71125","definition":"一加一所得的数目。","pronunciation":["이ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/95d00d73838348a4d34c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18381-3-7-2","ko":"그래? 처음에 4번으로 적었다가 2번으로 고쳤는데 맞았네.","zh":"是吗？我一开始选了四，后来改成二，原来答对了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처음에","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"4번으로","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号；4：数字。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적었다가","meaning":"写","explanation":"적다：写；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71234","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"2번으로","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号；2：数字。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고쳤는데","meaning":"改正，纠正","explanation":"고치다：改正，纠正；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"3","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞았네.","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"号","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"给某人或某物标的号码。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"71234","definition":"把内容用文字书写处理。","pronunciation":["적따"]},{"id":"594fd99add1f497b","term":"고치다","zh":"改正，纠正","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3","entryId":"18381","definition":"使过错或错误变得正确。","pronunciation":["고치다"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"正确，对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"问题的答案没有错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/71a29a07896ff09d3688.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.18,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18381","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.6044,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说第三题的答案是选项二。","是吗？我一开始选了四，后来改成二，原来答对了。","你打算把我们一直放在外面到什么时候？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说第三题的答案是选项二。","是吗？我一开始选了四，后来改成二，原来答对了。","你打算把我们一直放在外面到什么时候？"],"answer":1}]}
